{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
  MyFrequentRewards — lifecycle email system v6
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 01. Password never set
  File       : case1-password.liquid
  Class      : Case 1 (transactional — no unsubscribe)
  Trigger    : Registered on the panel portal but never set a password
  Tone        : welcome

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. {{ member.first_name | default: "Your" }}, your account is registered but not yet usable
    2. Your Prize Machine is locked — a password is the key
    3. One step left: set your MyFrequentRewards password

  PREHEADER
    Without a password we cannot send you anything. Setting one takes about 40 seconds.

  PRIMARY CTA
    Set my password  ->  links.set_password

  PLAIN-TEXT ALTERNATIVE
    dist/text/case1-password.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.
    HTML-only mail is scored down by most spam filters.

  Generated from react/src/emails/case1-password.jsx — edit the JSX and re-run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.

  Images are served from the base configured at build time; upload assets/
  there before sending. Serve over HTTPS from a stable path — clients do not
  retry a 404, so a moved asset breaks every copy already delivered.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
